1
00:00:00,819 --> 00:00:02,589
(Howard:)Never mind.

2
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:07,590
(Sheldon(on phone):)Hello, Amy. It's Sheldon.

3
00:00:07,592 --> 00:00:09,892
Yeah, I-I know
that we're broken up, but

4
00:00:09,894 --> 00:00:12,194
(Sheldon(on phone):)I'm leaving this message because
I thought perhaps you'd like

5
00:00:12,197 --> 00:00:15,867
(Sheldon(on phone):)to watch me be interviewed for
a documentary about Mr. Spock.

6
00:00:15,867 --> 00:00:19,637
(Sheldon(on phone):)Or as I like to call it,
a Spockumentary.

7
00:00:19,637 --> 00:00:21,007
(Sheldon(on phone):)Yeah, I'm going to use

8
00:00:21,005 --> 00:00:23,105
(Sheldon(on phone):)that joke in the interview,
so try to laugh

9
00:00:23,108 --> 00:00:25,378
(Sheldon(on phone):)like you're hearing it
for the first time.

10
00:00:25,376 --> 00:00:27,176
(Sheldon(on phone):)You know, hysterically, hmm?

11
00:00:27,178 --> 00:00:31,078
(Sheldon(on phone):)And with a tinge of sadness
that I'm no longer in your life.

12
00:00:31,082 --> 00:00:33,652
(Leonard:)I'm the one who thought
of “Spockumentary”"

13
00:00:33,651 --> 00:00:36,121
(Penny:)And I'm laughing like I did
the first time I heard it.

14
00:00:36,121 --> 00:00:38,851
(knocking on door)

15
00:00:40,191 --> 00:00:41,191
(Sheldon(on phone):)Hello.

16
00:00:41,192 --> 00:00:42,262
(Wil Wheaton:)Hey, Sheldon.

17
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:43,390
(Wil Wheaton:)This is Adam Nimoy.

18
00:00:43,394 --> 00:00:45,824
(Adam:)Nice to meet you.
Oh, it's nice to meet you.

19
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:48,200
(Sheldon:)I admire your father's work
very much.

20
00:00:48,199 --> 00:00:50,999
(Sheldon:)It's not every day I get to meet
someone whose life's journey

21
00:00:51,002 --> 00:00:53,502
(Sheldon:)began in my hero's scrotum.

22
00:00:55,774 --> 00:01:03,024
(Wil:)I told you.
This guy is gold.

